{"affiliation": "Kuba Gretzky (Evilginx)", "archived": false, "categories": ["Phishing & Initial Access"], "created_at": "2017-04-02T12:37:34Z", "description": "PLEASE USE NEW VERSION: https://github.com/kgretzky/evilginx2", "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T15:19:31Z", "forks": 283, "full_name": "kgretzky/evilginx", "language": "Python", "latest_release": {"assets": [], "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kgretzky/evilginx/releases/6570374/assets", "author": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19260967?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/kgretzky", "id": 19260967, "login": "kgretzky", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjYwOTY3", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kgretzky", "user_view_type": "public"}, "body": "version 1.1.0 (2017-06-01):\r\n[+] Added iCloud.com support.\r\n[+] Added Live.com support.\r\n[+] Specifying domain name with 'setup --enable' is now optional if site was enabled before.\r\n[+] Added ability to specify custom SSL/TLS certificates with --crt and --key arguments.\r\n    Custom certificates will be remembered and can be removed with --use_letsencrypt parameter.\r\n[+] Added 'server_names_hash_bucket_size: 128' to support long hostnames.\r\n[+] Fixed rare issue, which could be triggered when only visitor's email was identified at the time\r\n    of truncating logs, after parsing, breaking the chain of logged requests, which would miss an\r\n    email address on next parse.\r\n[+] Fixed several typos in site config files. (@poweroftrue)\r\n[+] Fixed issue with Nginx proxy bailing out on receiving too big upstream responses.\r\n[+] Fixed issue with Facebook overwriting redirection cookie with 'deleted' (@poweroftrue)\r\n[+] Fixed \"speedbump\" redirection for Google site config that asks user to provide his phone number.\r\n[+] Fixed bug that would raise exception when disabling site configs without them being enabled first.\r\n[+] Nginx access_log directory can now be changed with VAR_LOGS constant in evilginx.py.\r\n[+] Added 'update.sh' file which should be executed after every 'git pull' to update nginx config files.\r\n[+] Added Dockerfile", "created_at": "2017-06-01T08:06:35Z", "draft": false, "html_url": "https://github.com/kgretzky/evilginx/releases/tag/1.1.0", "id": 6570374, "immutable": false, "name": "1.1.0", "node_id": "MDc6UmVsZWFzZTY1NzAzNzQ=", "prerelease": false, "published_at": "2017-06-01T10:29:12Z", "tag_name": "1.1.0", "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kgretzky/evilginx/tarball/1.1.0", "target_commitish": "master", "updated_at": "2017-06-01T10:29:12Z", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/kgretzky/evilginx/releases/6570374/assets{?name,label}", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kgretzky/evilginx/releases/6570374", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kgretzky/evilginx/zipball/1.1.0"}, "name": "evilginx", "owner": "kgretzky", "pushed_at": "2022-02-06T11:44:11Z", "sources": ["watchlist"], "stars": 1250, "tags": [], "topics": [], "url": "https://github.com/kgretzky/evilginx"}
